7) Recommendation algorithm (high level)
- POST /recommendations/{student_id}:
  - Steps:
    1. Load Student by id (student.bac_average)
    2. Query AdmissionRule join Program where min_average <= student.bac_average
    3. Rank results (descending by (student.bac_average - min_average) or program.min_score)
    4. Create OrientationResult rows for returned programs with decision "eligible"
    5. Return list of recommendations (program_id, program_name, decision, score)

