- A) Apply these files into your repo (I will provide patches for any existing files to replace).
- B) Add require_role implementation into jwt.py (if you want strong role guards; I used require_role in some routers but you may already have it — if not I will add it).
- C) Link Student -> User by adding user_id FK and migration steps.

Which next step?

ons-said: A

