ons-said: should I run it a new powershell

GitHub Copilot: GitHub Copilot

Yes, you should run your **frontend** and **backend** in **separate terminals** (PowerShell windows or tabs):

- **Backend:**  
  In one terminal, from your project root:  
  ```powershell
  uvicorn app.main:app --reload
  ```

- **Frontend:**  
  In a **new** terminal, go to your frontend folder:  
  ```powershell
  cd frontend
  npm start
  ```

This way, both servers run at the same time and your app will work correctly.

